From 4f3a58cc8ebf8b6d5bbb7db5e6e296b3af99a392 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Killy <308386066+killy-netsphere@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:40:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 133/141] GGML_CUDA_DENSE_CUBLAS routed in ggml_cuda_mul_mat
 (contiguous weights with a converter only); GGML_CUDA_FUSE_IQ3_XXS=1: the
 fused gate/up/GLU MMQ kernel for IQ3_XXS weights

---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu       | 36 +++++++++++++++++++++------
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq-load-tiles.cuh |  5 ++--
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq.cu             |  5 +---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq.cuh            |  9 ++++---
 tests/test-backend-ops.cpp            |  8 ++++++
 5 files changed, 45 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu
